{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VZEvNpx1si1795600518.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>會計師行安永預計，本港新股集資額將創5年新高。</p><p></p><p>全年有逾4,300億元，按年升五成，排名全球第二，宗數也將是全球前列，涉及逾140宗，按年增加兩成三。主要由「A+H」上市浪潮，及科技股帶動。</p><p></p><p>而展望2027年，隨著市場情緒逐步企穩，大型項目陸續推進，加上本港上市制度持續優化，預期港股新股活動將保持活躍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.500716+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T09:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T13:57:23.140189+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T10:37:18.101908+00:00","content_hash":"b29dc01447ebcd4f84afa70510edb95462e3fdd681d1ee5ea8856e30988c601b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}